OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS actress Selma Blair accused of
OL,4,Aassault after incident with flight
OL,5,Aattendants
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirport officials said they had
OL,8,Fresponded to a call on Sunday about "a
OL,9,Fphysically abusive passenger" on the
OL,10,Fflight. Two flight attendants were hurt
OL,11,Fand one was taken to hospital, the New
OL,12,FYork Port Authority said.
OL,14,FBlair, 54, who also starred in Hellboy
OL,15,Fand Cruel Intentions, was arrested and
OL,16,Ftaken to hospital. Her publicist told
OL,17,Fthe BBC she had "experienced a medical
OL,18,Femergency that led to the alleged
OL,19,Fconduct".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
